<title>USA: NPC completes Pizza Hut acquisition.</title>
<headline>NPC completes Pizza Hut acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURG, Kan. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>NPC International Inc said Thursday it acquired 31 units in North Carolina from R &amp; W Pizza Huts of North Carolina, buying 28 restaurants and three delivery carryout units in Fayetteville, N.C. and surrounding areas.</p>
<p>It said the acquired properties generate annual volumes exceeding $780,000. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>NPC, the largest Pizza Hut franchisee, operates 406 Pizza Hut restaurants and delivery kitchens in 11 states.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
